AtlanticOS: retain seven verbatim native thread RO helpers from bsd_kern.c.
Zone membership, owner validation, panic and early-bootstrap NULL semantics
are unchanged. The native THREAD_RO zone remains owned by thread.c.

diff --git a/osfmk/kern/atlantic_thread_metadata.c b/osfmk/kern/atlantic_thread_metadata.c
new file mode 100644
